# Paths that decide whether the rest of the tree is allowed to land (#421).
#
# Branch protection must require a review from a code owner for these paths, and must
# require the branch to be up to date before merging. The review requirement lives in
# repository settings, not in this file — see SECURITY.md, "Release and CI integrity".
#
# The gate judges the PR; nothing may let a PR rewrite the judge without a second person
# signing off. `.github/` covers the workflows and the three budget/baseline files.

